      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "I believe this is *extremely* important due to the ongoing litigations against Persona in Illinois court at the minute.\n\nRe: Johnson et al v. Persona Identities, case 1:2024cv11249.\n\nIt appears Persona does NOT follow GDPR. VRChat should automatically invoke the right to be forgotten for a user pertaining to the data used for verify for VRC.\n\nPersona appears to be quite a shady company at best, and with the possibility of them mishandling EU citizen data should be enough of a concern for this to be implemented.\n\nIf not, at least handhold users into invoking their right to be forgotten with Persona.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    },
