  "companyID": "58c62e995865713647a7115d",
  "created": "2024-12-06T02:24:35.057Z",
  "deletedAt": null,
  "deletedBy": null,
  "details": "In the Age Verification FAQ, it says the following:\n\n> You may also request that Persona delete your ID data at any time. This will not affect your Age Verification status.\n\nThis feature request is to change this behavior when you age-verify your account. Once VRChat confirms through Persona that you are age verified, Persona should delete all their information on you. \n\nIf VRChat is saying, \"[Deleting your data with Persona] will not affect your Age Verification status,\" then that process needs to be automatic and should not be on the user to do.",
